{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into <strong>Psycho Partisans</strong>\u2014a short experience that\u2019s more art and a statement than a traditional game. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954350/extras/bbd90a50de1ffafef447b4f32de9179f.avif?t=1767474628\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>All enemy names and faces are real. They belonged to people who committed crimes against humanity.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The story is dramatized, but it\u2019s rooted in true events\u2014tragic, and without a happy ending.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954350/extras/de6ebecd7f432e5a9beace0338f588ff.avif?t=1767474628\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:\u00a0Survive the brutal grip of Belarusian impostor's dictatorship,\u00a0 mixed with\u00a0mythology with true tales of Belarusian heroes battling for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:\u00a0\u00a0Belarus, 2021. After rigged presidential elections, terror grips the nation: police hunt protesters, prisons echo with torture, and streets run red with violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the chaos, you are Andrew\u2014a 30-year-old IT programmer seeking escape in a quiet evening of coding. He's building a simple game about the elections to upload online... but nothing stays simple.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MATURE CONTENT DESCRIPTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developers describe the content like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954350?t=1767474628","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954350/0400761e19e0f078371fc4aa2f2715382af525ec/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767474628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954350/57d95f09ec81c5dd826171c2d5a0bdeb15098d01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767474628","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954350/57d95f09ec81c5dd826171c2d5a0bdeb15098d01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767474628","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Extreme violence"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into <strong>Psycho Partisans</strong>\u2014a short experience that\u2019s more art and a statement than a traditional game. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954350/extras/bbd90a50de1ffafef447b4f32de9179f.avif?t=1767474628\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>All enemy names and faces are real. They belonged to people who committed crimes against humanity.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The story is dramatized, but it\u2019s rooted in true events\u2014tragic, and without a happy ending.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954350/extras/de6ebecd7f432e5a9beace0338f588ff.avif?t=1767474628\" width=1232 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:\u00a0Survive the brutal grip of Belarusian impostor's dictatorship,\u00a0 mixed with\u00a0mythology with true tales of Belarusian heroes battling for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:\u00a0\u00a0Belarus, 2021. After rigged presidential elections, terror grips t